title: 'statement-store: on-demand v2 DHT soak zombienet test'

doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Adds a zombienet soak of the statement store v2 DHT path under continuous load, on a network
    sized `nodes > replication_factor > gossip_target + 1`: the smallest one where a replica set
    capped at `gossip_target + 1` copies shows at all. Every wave asserts that a subscriber
    received each ring statement and that probes and ring samples are stored on their
    `replication_factor` XOR-closest nodes, the ring ones also on the subscriber, and nowhere else;
    the soak ends with a scan of every node's log for statement errors. It runs only by a manual
    dispatch of `.github/workflows/zombienet_statement-store-soak.yml` onto the zombienet k8s
    cluster, sized by `.github/zombienet-tests/zombienet_statement_store_soak_tests.yml` with
    per-run overrides for the node count, the soak window and the build run, or locally as the
    test's module docs describe. It is not part of the default per-PR zombienet matrix.
crates: []
